~ start

if flag("met_snail")
	Snail: Back again? The grass hasn't got any shorter.
	- Have you seen any crumbs?
		Snail: Only the ones I ate.
	- See you later!
		Snail: Mind your antennae.
else
	Snail: Oh! A band, and such a small one. Hello!
	Snail: Have you come all this way to play for me?
	- Yes, we're musicians!
		Snail: Then come back when you know a song.
	- We're only passing through.
		Snail: Follow the stepping stones south, then.
	do set_flag("met_snail")

=> END
